{"id":"udachno","lemma":"удачно","pos":"adv","rank":2456,"glosses":["fortunately, luckily"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/3e/Ru-%D1%83%D0%B4%D0%B0%D1%87%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D1%83%D0%B4%D0%B0%D1%87%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Это очень удачно, что вы сегодня пришли.","en":"It was very lucky that you came today.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"very"},null,{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"you (pl. / formal)"},{"g":"today"},{"g":"to come , to arrive","l":"прийти"}]},{"text":"Они удачно поохотились.","en":"They had a good hunt.","words":[{"g":"they"},null,null]},{"text":"Удачно долететь.","en":"Have a good flight.","words":[null,{"g":"to fly , to reach"}]},{"text":"Ваша фотография, которую я сделал на прошлой неделе, вышла очень удачно.","en":"The picture I took of you last week turned out very well.","words":[{"g":"your, yours","l":"ваш"},{"g":"photograph"},null,{"g":"I"},{"g":"to make, to do","l":"сделать"},{"g":"on / at"},null,null,{"g":"to exit, to go out","l":"выйти"},{"g":"very"},null]},{"text":"Эта операция закончилась удачно.","en":"The surgery was successful.","words":[null,{"g":"operation"},{"g":"to finish","l":"закончиться"},null]}]}